id: key-grammar-dash-prefix-identity
category: key-grammar
images: rs-oracle9
targets: rhel9
key: kernel.randomize_va_space
xfail_issue: 
comment: the ignore-error dash prefix does not change key IDENTITY: a dash-prefixed earlier assignment and a plain later assignment of the same key are recognized as the SAME key by the real oracle (confirmed: 'Overwriting earlier assignment of kernel/randomize_va_space'), matching RuleSteward's dash-stripped canonical form.
